./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3397:Reconciliation protocol:
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3399:- if any required independent verifier verdict is `fail` or `blocked`, local
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3400:  review certification or `fullAuthorityDone` is blocked with
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3401:  `multi_host_disagreement`;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3402:- if all failing findings map to planned repair policy and budget remains, the
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3403:  executor may return the Story to DEV, run repair steps, and revalidate;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3404:- after any repair that changes artifacts, evidence, material hash, local
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3405:  lifecycle state, planned-step outputs, or Authority gate input, all previous
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3406:  affected verdicts are stale for final certification;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3407:- after such repair in local mode, Proofbound must rerun validation, compute fresh
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3408:  local anchors, and start a fresh review wave;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3409:- after such repair in Authority mode, Proofbound must rerun validation, rebuild
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3410:  gate input, request and verify a fresh `gate_decision` receipt, and then start
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3411:  a fresh review wave over the new chain;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3412:- if findings cannot be repaired unattended, the run stops blocked with the
