./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3547:| M12 | Deployment And Global Verification | Postgres-backed server, key pinning, HTTPS/tunnel, global `lattice`, and full test matrix pass. |
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3548:| M13 | Proofbound Story Planner | Natural-language requests produce reviewed Story drafts, background, checklist, verification intent, assumptions, and scope questions. |
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3549:| M14 | Proofbound Job Planner | Story + verification intent produce signed Authority jobs with typed `plannedSteps[]`, policies, and planner digests. |
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3550:| M15 | Natural-Language-To-DONE E2E | `lattice planner run --mode=authority --until=DONE` creates Story/job, runs Stage B, verifies receipt, reports authority DONE or blocked, and includes source-aligned redevelopment E2E fixtures when that workflow is selected. |
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3551:| M16 | Multi-Host Final Verification | At least two independent hosts, with 2-3 hosts per review wave and optional 3+ release certification including Gemini when available, submit verifier verdicts, reconcile disagreements, and verify local or Authority final artifacts before local certified DONE or full authority DONE is claimed. |
