./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3775:1. Run V1 first. If HTTP `localhost:6789` cannot be started or the policy
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3776:   server key cannot be pinned, stop and fix only that correctness blocker.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3777:2. Run V2 after V1 passes. V2 proves the live control plane and the
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3778:   cross-language body shapes before any higher-level DONE claim.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3779:3. Run V3 with at least one no-job control-plane path and one claimed-job path.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3780:   If the live server cannot issue or verify the required gate receipt, stop at
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3781:   blocked M10/M11 instead of claiming Authority DONE.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3782:4. Run V4 only after V3 proves the executor can consume a live Authority job.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3783:5. Run V5 to prove the global binary is not stale and does not secretly use a
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3784:   package-local `bin/lattice.js` path.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3785:6. Run V6 last. If any verifier finds a real blocker, repair the blocker and
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3786:   rerun the affected verification milestone plus V6.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3788:Minimum final evidence bundle:
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3790:- command transcript for each V1-V6 command;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3791:- non-authority CLI transcript proving local execution succeeds without server
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3792:  contact and without Authority DONE flags;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3793:- Python server startup command, URL, and policy response digest;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3794:- pinned server public key and key id;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3795:- customer key id/source status, actor id, runner id, session id, project id,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3796:  and key source summary with private material redacted;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3797:- live job id, run id, receipt id, and evidence refs when a job is claimed;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3798:- explicit proof that `test:authority-live-python` did not skip;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3799:- global `lattice` binary realpath/version;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3800:- three bounded host-check wave summaries, with at least two independent host
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3801:  verdict artifacts per wave and the four required review principles recorded
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3803:- final status object distinguishing `localDone`, `authorityDone`,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3804:  `fullAuthorityDone`, `receiptVerified`, and `multiHostVerified`.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3808:- a non-authority pass cannot be promoted to Authority DONE;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3809:- an authority run without server evidence cannot be reported as
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3810:  `authorityDone`;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3811:- alternate-port evidence is useful diagnostic evidence but does not satisfy the
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3812:  final localhost 6789 claim;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3813:- stub evidence proves deterministic behavior but does not satisfy live
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3814:  Authority evidence;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3815:- schema-only evidence proves body shape but does not satisfy server
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3817:- if a repair changes code, policy, docs, server config, or material hash, rerun
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3818:  the affected verification milestone and then V6;
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3819:- if a proposed change is only an optimization, style cleanup, or unrelated
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3820:  hardening, defer it to a follow-up Story.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3822:### Twenty-Five Required Blocks For This Pass
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3824:The following twenty-five blocks are mandatory for this implementation pass.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3825:They are not optional enhancements. If any block is missing, Proofbound must not
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3826:claim full unattended development mode.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3829:   Proofbound Authority must dispatch jobs that include `plannedSteps[]`, retry
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3830:   policy, stop policy, lease metadata, evidence policy, provider policy, and
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3831:   receipt policy, and multi-host policy. The claimed job payload must be
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3832:   complete enough that the runner does not guess what to do.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3835:   `lattice autopilot execute --mode=authority` must claim an authority job,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3836:   consume `plannedSteps[]`, execute typed steps, heartbeat, renew leases,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3837:   upload evidence, retry or repair when policy allows, and release or complete
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3840:3. **Provider executor.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3841:   The executor must support `provider.fake` for deterministic E2E,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3842:   `provider.codex` for real bounded development, and `provider.claude` behind
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3843:   an explicit enable flag. All providers must run in the authoritative story
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3844:   worktree and must capture structured execution evidence.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3846:4. **Evidence upload loop.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3847:   The executor must upload provider events, command events, validation
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3848:   evidence, git evidence, gate requests, and stop summaries to Proofbound
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3849:   Authority. Local logs alone are not sufficient.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3851:5. **Validation, repair, retry, and safe stop.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3852:   Validation failure must trigger a configured repair/retry path or a clear
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3853:   blocked stop. Provider timeout, repeated no-progress, receipt failure, dirty
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3854:   unrelated worktree, and unsafe lease state must all stop safely with an
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3855:   uploaded or locally printed final summary.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3857:6. **Gate evaluation and receipt verification.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3858:   The executor must automatically call `/v1/gates/evaluate`, fetch or receive a
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3859:   native `gate_decision` receipt, verify project/story/kind/server key id,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3860:   `decisionDigest`, freshness when enabled, and Ed25519 signature, then fail
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3861:   closed on any mismatch.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3863:7. **End-to-end verification matrix.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3864:   The pass must prove fake provider happy path, fake validation failure repair,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3865:   gate rejection, tampered receipt rejection, Codex provider happy path, Codex
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3866:   timeout handling, dirty worktree protection, local/shadow autopilot
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3867:   regression, and global `lattice` execution.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3869:8. **Proofbound Story Planner.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3870:   Proofbound must turn a natural-language request into a reviewed Story draft with
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3871:   background, checklist, verification intent, assumptions, scope questions,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3872:   risk classification, related docs, and source-aligned redevelopment
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3873:   workflow intent. Story creation must use Proofbound commands only.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3875:9. **Proofbound Job Planner.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3876:   Proofbound must turn Story + verification intent into a signed Authority job
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3877:   with typed `plannedSteps[]`, retry policy, stop policy, evidence policy,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3878:   receipt policy, provider policy, worktree policy, and planner digests.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3880:10. **Natural-language-to-DONE E2E.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3881:    The pass must prove `lattice planner run --request=... --mode=authority
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3882:    --until=DONE` can create the Story, create the Authority job, run Stage B,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3883:    verify the native receipt, and report authority DONE or blocked according to
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3884:    gate outcome.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3886:11. **One-sentence and paragraph request intake.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3887:    The planner must accept both inline one-sentence/paragraph requests and
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3888:    multi-paragraph `--requestFile` input. It must hash the original request,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3889:    preserve materially important wording in evidence, and normalize both forms
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3892:    Source-aligned redevelopment workflow intake must also accept an authorized
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3893:    source codebase ref, target project path/name, source/target language ids,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3894:    rename map, redevelopment scope, language adapter policy, semantic mapping
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3895:    policy, and parity oracle policy without treating redevelopment as a fourth
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3898:12. **Structured planner output gate.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3899:    Planner output must be schema-validated JSON with no placeholders, complete
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3900:    verification intent, explicit assumptions, and explicit blocked questions
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3901:    for high-risk ambiguity.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3903:13. **Story lifecycle bootstrap.**
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3904:    Natural-language-to-DONE must create or reuse the Story, materialize
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3905:    checklist and verification intent, advance through required lifecycle gates,
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3906:    create or resolve the story worktree, and enter the legal execution phase
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3907:    before provider work starts.
./docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md:3909:14. **Checklist-to-evidence coverage binding.**
